Fan-project notice / 同人作品声明

LambDice is an unofficial fan-made recreation of the Knucklebones mini-game from
"Cult of the Lamb". The original game, its characters, names and setting are the
property of Massive Monster and Devolver Digital.

This project does not include any asset from the original game: every texture,
sprite, sound effect and icon in this repository is generated procedurally in
code at runtime. The MIT license above applies to that original source code
only; it does not grant any rights to the original game's intellectual property.

本项目是非官方的同人复刻作品，与 Massive Monster / Devolver Digital 没有任何关联，
也未获得其授权。《咩咩启示录 / Cult of the Lamb》及其角色、名称、世界观归原作者所有。

仓库内不包含任何来自原作的美术或音频素材——所有贴图、精灵、音效与图标都是代码运行时
程序化生成的。上面的 MIT 协议仅覆盖这些原创代码，不涉及原作的任何知识产权。
本项目仅供学习交流，请勿用于商业用途。
